{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16088","headline":"同于汝锡游降圣观 · 王建","name":"同于汝锡游降圣观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦时桃树满山坡，骑鹿先生降大罗。\n路尽溪头逢地少，门连内里见天多。\n荒泉坏简朱砂暗，古塔残经篆字讹。\n闻说开元斋醮日，晓移行漏帝亲过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}